  "notes": [
    "Fully regular reflexive -IR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: recibido (regular)",
    "Latin American usage: *recibirse de* + profession = to graduate as: *Se recibió de médico* = He graduated as a doctor / qualified as a doctor",
    "In Spain the equivalent is *licenciarse* or *graduarse*",
    "Non-reflexive *recibir* = to receive: *Recibí una carta* = I received a letter",
    "Related: el recibo (receipt), la recepción (reception), el/la graduado/a (graduate)"
